</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Before the upstayed arm</l><l>The ranks of darkness quailed!</l><l>In great Jehovah’s Name</l><l>The hosts of light prevailed!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Teach us to bind the foe</l><l>With iron chains of prayer,</l><l>That all Thy Church may move</l><l>To victory everywhere.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Give us the steady arm,</l><l>Until the sun go down,</l><l>That we in Christ may win</l><l>The overcomer’s crown.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
